    # CLAW × Doginal Dogs — Community Perks & Access

    > **Purpose:**  
    > Doginal Dogs provide cultural distribution and early-adopter incentives for CLAW.  
    > They confer **no legal authority**, **no governance power**, and **no influence over outcomes**.

    ---

    ## Design Rule (Non-Negotiable)

    Doginal ownership affects:
    - pricing
    - access
    - priority

    Doginal ownership does **not** affect:
    - proof validity
    - determinations
    - escrow outcomes
    - appeals
    - legal authority

    ---

    ## Doginal Perks Table

    | CLAW Feature | Standard User | Doginal Dog Holder |
    |-------------|--------------|--------------------|
    | Receipt creation | Standard quota | +20–50% monthly quota |
    | Agreement drafting | Standard tier | Discounted tier pricing |
    | Automated Determinations | Pay-per-use | Reduced credit cost |
    | Priority processing | Standard queue | Priority queue |
    | New feature access | General release | Early access |
    | Community tools | Public | Exclusive previews |
    | Support | Standard | Faster response window |

    *(Exact percentages and prices are configurable; the principle is access, not power.)*

    ---

    ## Why This Works (Plain English)

    - Doginals help CLAW reach users before legal crisis
    - Users get benefits without contaminating authority
    - CLAW avoids “token = truth” or “DAO decides facts”
    - Courts and auditors never need to consider Doginals at all

    ---

    ## Optional Payment Rail

    - Dogecoin may be accepted as an optional payment method
    - DOGE is a convenience rail, not a reserve or governance asset
    - Treasury policy remains BTC + stablecoins

    ---

    ## One-Sentence Positioning

    > **Doginal Dogs help people discover and access CLAW — they never decide outcomes.**

